{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S08、S11、S12等短停留段仍堆叠了较多话语和感受，观众容易来不及扫完，X的左右分栏在这些段落更轻松。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】把每段真正重要的叙事信息突出出来，观众不必逐字读完就能抓住人物当下的处境和矛盾；感受又有不少按音乐段落出现，减少了同时面对一大堆词的负担。更重要的是，Y把想念、委屈、孤独、自我保护和重新向前之间的因果联系交代得更清楚，音乐感受也有具体的身体反应、音色、节奏和情绪转折，不只是给情绪贴标签。X在短段落的快速浏览上更从容，但右侧词语容易成为彼此并列的感受清单，细腻程度和前后推进的连贯性不及Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a8134f9b-7833-442e-9615-bdaf2da19212", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T062044412952Z", "elapsed_seconds": 60.125, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:21:44.555119+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6272a9f7378da8666fb9722019655ee39ffde2e821aca7fa6d83037aa08c8b9c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "